<title>JAPAN: Daiichi Corp to change name to Deo Deo Corp.</title>
<headline>Daiichi Corp to change name to Deo Deo Corp.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiichi Corp, a large-scale retailer of consumer electronics in Japan, said on Tuesday it will change its company name next April 1.</p>
<p>The new name will be Deo Deo Corp, a Daiichi statement said.</p>
<p>The company enjoys a large market share in the Chugoku area of Japan, especially in Hiroshima where it is based.</p>
</text>
